2026-10-20T07:48:35.1632932Z PASS repo with .git DIR contributes each convention subdir it has
2026-10-20T07:48:35.1636564Z PASS a git WORKTREE (.git file) counts as a repo
2026-10-20T07:48:35.1637259Z PASS a directory WITHOUT .git is not a repo
2026-10-20T07:48:35.1637716Z PASS a repo without any listed subdir contributes nothing
2026-10-20T07:48:35.1638199Z PASS an excluded child NAME is skipped even when it is a repo
2026-10-20T07:48:35.1638605Z PASS a missing parent is skipped silently
2026-10-20T07:48:35.1639001Z PASS discovered roots are articles, and marked
2026-10-20T07:48:35.1661958Z PASS explicit + discovered are unioned
2026-10-20T07:48:35.1664778Z PASS a path in both appears once, keeping the explicit entry
2026-10-20T07:48:35.1669035Z PASS exclude is handed to the builder
2026-10-20T07:48:35.1671444Z PASS skipNames extends the built-in set, never replaces it
2026-10-20T07:48:35.1699814Z PASS no discover block = no discovery
2026-10-20T07:48:35.1701088Z PASS an existing sources.json is NOT rewritten with a discover block
